<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/objectives/rich-naturalistic-data> dcterms:description "Develop and test better ways to analyse brain activity and behaviour during rich experiences, such as watching a film.\n\nFilms combine images, sound, and events that unfold over time. Understanding the brain's responses takes methods that can handle these details together. We develop and test ways to make that analysis more reliable and practical, so researchers can learn more from the same recordings. This builds on [Psychoinformatics' objective for naturalistic studies](https://www.psychoinformatics.de/objectives/b6e7dfb2-3534-487e-bd8a-d2f58ec47e47/).";
    a xyzri:XYZObjective;
    dlthings:title "Understand brain function during everyday experiences".

