<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/objectives/translational-research-infrastructure> dcterms:description "Develop and test software, data standards, and analysis workflows that help researchers put new methods into practice.\n\nNew methods become useful when other researchers can run them, inspect them, and build on them. We work with research communities to develop and test software, ways of organizing data, and analysis steps that work together. This helps people use research methods in their own studies.";
    a xyzri:XYZObjective;
    dlthings:title "Turn research ideas into working tools".
